:0.9419822692871094,"text_excerpt":"Excellent place! Glad we found them. Their ramen was the best I had anywhere. There burger had such great flavor in the meat it was like a perfect home grilled burger. Great job. The Brussels salad is an interesting dish and done gracefully. The scallops were just ok, seemed like it was lacking in an ingredient. The empanadas were awesome as well, almost fluffy and sweet like a beignet. The kale salad the gf loved It, wasn't my flavor. Yea we ordered a lot and it was a worthy experience. We would definitely go here again and will next time we are down. The bartender was just fun and real as most of the staff is. It was entertaining to say the least. I could see how the one person complain..."},{"business_id":"6Aa0t9YWJNknGP9tHWmG5Q","review_id":"oc24lw3Sm3juQK8FFHTAmA","date":"2015-07-11T21:58:18","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9397662878036499,"text_excerpt":"I had a really good experience here. There's a lot to like about this place. The decor being one of my favorite things about this new restaurant. I love the high, exposed ceilings which are met by brick accented walls, spotted with some really cool art work. When you first walk in there are these cool, not-so-little couches in the front window, ideal for a group having some coctails. About the coctails, they're magnificent. There's also the noteworthy bar that you come across before entering the dining area. I came here once when it was a burger joint, but they've done well with the place in its new venture. You also wanna note it's only street parking around here, i recommend coming afte..."},{"business_id":"6Aa0t9YWJNknGP9tHWmG5Q","review_id":"o6Eb-X4Fa-ZTgC3YjXYDHA","date":"2015-09-05T03:46:21","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9363598823547363,"text_excerpt":"I'm feeling generous because I love this city and Rebellion was our first stop here. Our experience was more of a 3.5 but I rounded up. The photos of the Rebellion Ramen looked incredible and it's been too long since I've had a great bowl of ramen so I immediately ordered that. Apparently I'll need to wait a bit longer. The egg and the pork belly were full of flavor and rave worthy but that's where it ended. Broth was thin, noodles disappointing. They were generous with the mushrooms which was nice. There was bits of bacon, pork, bok choy, several varieties of mushrooms, garlic but all of that did little to disguise the fact the the broth was lacking. Luckily for us, the special (yellowta..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"6Aa0t9YWJNknGP9tHWmG5Q","photo_id":"J3pfFfrpHzR8AUQrKgfdEQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/J3pfFfrpHzR8AUQrKgfdEQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9158542156219482},{"business_id":"6Aa0t9YWJNknGP9tHWmG5Q","photo_id":"lyh-d9HwF4sN2e7ln06o4Q","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/lyh-d9HwF4sN2e7ln06o4Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9109618663787842},{"business_id":"6Aa0t9YWJNknGP9tHWmG5Q","photo_id":"UQhKv5CoaBN55idb1_D5ug","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/UQhKv5CoaBN55idb1_D5ug.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9097254276275635},{"business_id":"6Aa0t9YWJNknGP9tHWmG5Q","photo_id":"4ocr22bfwjRLQp4W7jJtfw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/4ocr22bfwjRLQp4W7jJtfw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8288000226020813},{"business_id":"6Aa0t9YWJNknGP9tHWmG5Q","photo_id":"ufG2NBgD26Oq4uXjVfZROg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ufG2NBgD26Oq4uXjVfZROg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7894465327262878}]},"notebook_case":null}
